cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NDSR Folder Workflow"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hoch
    given-names: "Jonathan W."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4992-1199"
    affiliation: "Cardiovascular and Applied Physiology Laboratory, Florida State University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FSUcaplab/ndsr-toolkit"
url: "https://github.com/FSUcaplab/ndsr-toolkit"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-04-27
abstract: >-
  Python workflow for combining Nutrition Data System for Research (NDSR) raw
  text exports into a single master CSV, then selecting, filtering, averaging,
  and exporting nutrient outputs through a graphical user interface. Built for
  study folders in which each participant subfolder contains multiple NDSR
  text exports.
keywords:
  - NDSR
  - Nutrition Data System for Research
  - dietary assessment
  - nutrient analysis
  - data wrangling
  - research data management
